    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1.4">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 1.4</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">⁊ gif he ofer ðæt stalige, forgildon hy hine be his were oþþe hine eft ðær inne gebringan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he steals after that, they [his kinsmen] shall pay for him to the amount of his wergeld or put him back there.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">And gyf he ofer þæt stalie, ðonne forgyldan hi hine be his were oððe hine eft ingebringan.</ab>
      </div>
